              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "## The note\n\nSend this before the merge, so the bot carries the header on every request.\n\n```yaml\nRate limiting is going into the api in PR #150. The liquidation bot has to send one header on every api request.\n\nSet `service_key` per environment in the bot's own config.\n```\n\n> The api ignores the header until the limits are live, so it can ship first.\n\nNothing needs rotating for this. The api [reference](https://example.com/config) lists the other environments.\n\n---\n\nOne value per environment:\n\n| environment | key |\n| --- | --- |\n| staging | service_key |\n| production | service_key |"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
